<title>USA: ViroPharma Inc offers 2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>ViroPharma Inc offers 2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MALVERN, Pa. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ViroPharma Inc said Wednesday that it priced a public offering of 2,000,000 shares of common stock at $13.75 per share.</p>
<p>The stock traded Thursday morning at 14-7/8.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to use the money for pre-marketing and clinical development of pleconaril, as well as for general corporate purposes and capital expenditures.</p>
